ECDSA (P-256 / P-384) provider add-on for the AlgoVoi RFC 9421 verifier (Rust).
This is a PURE add-on: it depends on the core crate algovoi-rfc9421-verifier and
adds only the RFC 9421 ECDSA suites ecdsa-p256-sha256 and ecdsa-p384-sha384. The
core crate does not depend on this crate. Elliptic-curve operations use the
p256 and p384 crates.

